# Applied relative to the Docker build context (backend/).
# Keeps the build context lean and avoids sending secrets to the daemon.

# Dev dependencies installed locally — reinstalled in the container.
**/node_modules

# TypeScript compilation output — rebuilt in the container.
**/dist

# Test infrastructure not needed in production image.
**/tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/vitest.config.ts
**/.env*

# Editor and OS noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/Thumbs.db

# Version control — no git history needed in the image.
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Docker files themselves.
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
